    feature("Arena memory", "Stack-like arena allocation with stash semantics. Fast, predictable, and trivially safe — no GC pauses, ever.");
    feature("Single native binary", "York compiles straight to C and then to your platform's native code. Drop the binary anywhere; it just runs.");
